# Qin et al., Example 36 (pp. 118-119), modulo 65537, a0=b0=1 as in paper.
# Ten symbolic parameters remain. This is the full unspecialized example.
x1,x2,x3
65537
x2^2+a1*x1*x2+a2*x1^2+a3*x2+a4*x1+a5
x2^2+b1*x1*x2+b2*x1^2+b3*x2+b4*x1+b5
2*x2*x3+a1*x2^2+a1*x1*x3+2*a2*x1*x2+a3*x3+a4*x2
2*x2*x3+b1*x2^2+b1*x1*x3+2*b2*x1*x2+b3*x3+b4*x2
